# The All-New C-2000 (windurst 24), completion parity: 292's finish is the Lua's raw player:completeQuest (then fame,
# title, gil, the trade), so a GM's Quest[2][24]Prog survives the completion (quest:cleanup, which a called
# Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) beside Kopuro-Popuro.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-1.0,-4.75,-21.0 job=WAR lvl=75
item InsectWing
item RabbitHide
item TwoLeafMandragoraBud
login
quest Windurst.TheAllNewC2000 accepted
charvar Quest[2][24]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Kopuro-Popuro InsectWing x1 RabbitHide x1 TwoLeafMandragoraBud x1  # the three: 292 (200)
finish                                  # completed; fame 20; Cardian Tutor; 200 gil; the three taken; Prog kept
